1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,000
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Full Moon, Mid-Autumn)

3
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:43,200
You little wretch!

4
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:45,050
Give me the food!

5
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:45,700
Yuanqing!

6
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,950
Stop fighting them!

7
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:58,000
Don't hit my brother.
I'll give you all the food.

8
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:09,160
Stop fighting!

9
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:17,540
Come on! Try me again!

10
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:18,880
Over some food?

11
00:01:18,930 --> 00:01:19,910
Is it really worth it?

12
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,200
You're crazy.

13
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,790
Yuanqing, are you okay?

14
00:01:27,370 --> 00:01:28,120
Xiaoyue.

15
00:01:28,790 --> 00:01:29,790
Remember this.

16
00:01:30,330 --> 00:01:31,790
If anyone bullies us again,

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,120
we fight back.

18
00:01:36,770 --> 00:01:39,680
=Episode 12=
(Your Fate Is Your Own Call)

19
00:01:42,250 --> 00:01:44,250
Zhang Xiaohua of Caomiao Village.

20
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:45,410
(Yuyou Pool)
Born on the Full Moon,

21
00:01:45,660 --> 00:01:46,790
(Holy Maiden Pool)
aged fifteen.

22
00:01:46,910 --> 00:01:48,000
Accepted by Heaven.

23
00:01:48,370 --> 00:01:49,660
Purified and restored.

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,410
Lu Xiaoyue of Xianliang Village.

25
00:01:53,580 --> 00:01:56,090
Born on the New Moon, aged fifteen.

26
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,250
Accepted by Heaven.

27
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:58,620
Purified and restored.

28
00:02:01,250 --> 00:02:02,540
Today, receive God's blessing.

29
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,290
Zhang Xiaohua.

30
00:02:10,290 --> 00:02:11,250
Receive God's blessing?

31
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:13,040
What does that mean?

32
00:02:13,410 --> 00:02:14,420
It means

33
00:02:14,470 --> 00:02:16,750
you'll be blessed by God.

34
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,250
It's a good thing.

35
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:24,040
I won't go! I won't go!

36
00:02:24,660 --> 00:02:26,870
Please, I don't want to go!

37
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:29,120
I won't go. Let me go home!

38
00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:30,540
I want to go home!

39
00:02:30,660 --> 00:02:33,410
Please let me go home. I won't go!

40
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:34,830
I'll go in her place!

41
00:02:41,450 --> 00:02:42,250
Stop her!

42
00:03:26,830 --> 00:03:31,080
I want them all to die!

43
00:03:32,830 --> 00:03:35,080
I obey.

44
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:20,620
Xiaoyue, be good.

45
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:21,830
Wait for me at home.

46
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:24,150
Don't forget to buy me a tiger-head hat.

47
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:26,410
I'll wear it when we go to the Capital
to see the lanterns.

48
00:04:29,700 --> 00:04:31,870
Yuanqing, is that you?

49
00:04:37,450 --> 00:04:38,290
(Xiaoyue.)

50
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:39,540
(Remember.)

51
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,660
(If anyone bullies us again,)

52
00:04:41,790 --> 00:04:43,450
(we fight back.)

53
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:55,220
♪There are countless spring days♪

54
00:04:55,220 --> 00:04:57,160
♪And countless green mountains♪

55
00:04:57,520 --> 00:05:00,080
♪Amid the layered shadows♪

56
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,450
♪Follow heaven and earth for ages♪

57
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,450
♪No matter how long he lasts,
he cannot outlast♪

58
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,930
♪A hundred thousand hands♪

59
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,120
♪Push me forward together♪

60
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:13,540
♪The need for me to never look back♪

61
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:16,240
♪Countless spring days♪

62
00:05:19,750 --> 00:05:22,000
Xiaoyue, no matter where you are,

63
00:05:22,500 --> 00:05:23,910
no matter what happens,

64
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:26,000
I only want you to be happy.

65
00:05:27,470 --> 00:05:28,810
(Yuyou Village)

66
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,580
♪Pray with devotion♪

67
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:37,330
♪And no evil shall pass♪

68
00:05:37,410 --> 00:05:38,410
I'll ask only once.

69
00:05:38,790 --> 00:05:39,800
Where is the Holy Maiden?

70
00:05:39,850 --> 00:05:42,660
♪Those above are masters,
those below are beasts♪

71
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:48,080
♪Let all stay in their place,
and Heaven's order shall endure♪

72
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,760
Answer me.

73
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:56,620
♪Those who slay gods today
may become gods tomorrow♪

74
00:05:56,910 --> 00:05:58,870
♪There are countless spring days♪

75
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:01,120
♪And countless green mountains♪

76
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:04,160
♪Amid the layered shadows♪

77
00:06:05,900 --> 00:06:06,830
Why are you still here?

78
00:06:06,950 --> 00:06:08,050
The Porcelain Armored Soldiers
have stopped moving.

79
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,160
Let's get out of here.

80
00:06:10,250 --> 00:06:11,830
♪A hundred thousand hands♪

81
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:14,120
♪Push me forward together♪

82
00:06:15,910 --> 00:06:17,170
The gods said

83
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:18,950
we're not allowed to leave this room.

84
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:21,580
If we try to run,

85
00:06:21,790 --> 00:06:24,130
those two soldiers will kill us.

86
00:06:24,180 --> 00:06:25,380
The Eyes of Heaven are everywhere
above us.

87
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:26,950
No matter where we run,

88
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,880
the gods will drag us back.

89
00:06:28,930 --> 00:06:30,010
My brother came to save us.

90
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:31,790
This is our only chance to escape.

91
00:06:34,410 --> 00:06:36,790
Your brother will be taken
by the gods too.

92
00:06:36,910 --> 00:06:39,290
♪The crowd lifts me high♪

93
00:06:47,290 --> 00:06:48,750
Lu Yuanqing.

94
00:06:51,790 --> 00:06:53,120
I told you.

95
00:06:53,450 --> 00:06:55,660
You can't kill us.

96
00:06:56,790 --> 00:06:58,200
It's chaos out there.

97
00:06:58,290 --> 00:07:00,290
Go outside and see for yourselves.

98
00:07:01,410 --> 00:07:02,670
The gods said

99
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:04,540
we're not allowed to leave this room.

100
00:07:14,290 --> 00:07:15,420
Even if we get out

101
00:07:15,470 --> 00:07:16,170
and make it back to our villages,

102
00:07:16,220 --> 00:07:17,790
they'll just send us back here.

103
00:07:17,910 --> 00:07:19,290
This is our fate.

104
00:07:19,540 --> 00:07:21,580
The gods will punish the whole village,

105
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:23,700
and everyone will suffer because of us.

106
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:26,160
Do you know why we were sent here?

107
00:07:26,290 --> 00:07:27,510
We were chosen.

108
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,580
We accept our bad luck.

109
00:07:28,700 --> 00:07:29,840
Can't you just leave us alone?

110
00:07:29,890 --> 00:07:31,010
Stop making things worse for us.

111
00:07:31,060 --> 00:07:32,150
What does this have to do with you?

112
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,450
Exactly. This is our problem.

113
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:36,400
As long as people still fear us,

114
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:38,410
we can never die!

115
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:57,130
Do you know why

116
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,870
I offered to go in your place?

117
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:03,580
I was scared too.

118
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,200
Even more scared than you.

119
00:09:06,870 --> 00:09:08,290
But my brother said

120
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:11,370
he'd come save me. I believed him.

121
00:09:12,580 --> 00:09:13,540
And he came.

122
00:09:15,540 --> 00:09:16,790
He kept his word.

123
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:23,880
My brother always said,

124
00:09:23,930 --> 00:09:25,160
our fate

125
00:09:25,950 --> 00:09:27,410
is ours to decide.

126
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,250
I'll go with you.

127
00:10:02,790 --> 00:10:03,910
Me too.

128
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:07,200
I'll go with you too.

129
00:10:07,290 --> 00:10:08,010
So will I.

130
00:10:08,060 --> 00:10:08,880
Me too.

131
00:10:08,930 --> 00:10:09,790
Count me in.

132
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:10,950
I'm coming too.

133
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,370
So am I.

134
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,290
We'll go down the mountain together.

135
00:10:16,250 --> 00:10:17,080
Let's go.

136
00:10:29,290 --> 00:10:30,370
(Lu Yuanqing.)

137
00:10:30,580 --> 00:10:32,300
(With a heart free of striving,)

138
00:10:32,350 --> 00:10:34,120
(turn a thousand into one.)

139
00:10:34,250 --> 00:10:37,700
(Remember this strike well.)

140
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,750
Turbid Dragon. Fourth Strike!

141
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:45,790
End All Ancient Grudges!

142
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:47,160
Five pathetic worms dreaming
of becoming dragons.

143
00:11:47,870 --> 00:11:49,610
A thousand years ago,

144
00:11:49,660 --> 00:11:51,620
if they hadn't ambushed me,

145
00:11:51,790 --> 00:11:54,830
I would have sealed the Chi Dragon
in the Guixu Abyss.

146
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:57,200
A thousand-year grudge

147
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:59,780
will be settled today!

148
00:11:59,830 --> 00:12:01,290
Lu Yuanqing.

149
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:03,590
With my Reverse Scale,

150
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:06,500
tear open heaven and earth!

151
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:08,410
Open!

152
00:13:22,790 --> 00:13:23,830
Lu Yuanqing.

153
00:13:24,540 --> 00:13:29,950
I will teach you the Turbid Dragon's
final strike.

154
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,300
Together,

155
00:13:32,350 --> 00:13:34,620
we will slay this false dragon!

156
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:40,280
Dark clouds crush the city,
turbid waves arise!

157
00:13:40,330 --> 00:13:42,790
Dark clouds crush the city,
turbid waves arise!

158
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,150
- Cloud and dragon, rise with me!
- Cloud and dragon, rise with me!

159
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:59,620
- Shatter the Nine Heavens!
- Shatter the Nine Heavens!

160
00:14:30,910 --> 00:14:33,510
If even one escapes,

161
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:36,220
they'll rise again.

162
00:14:36,270 --> 00:14:40,870
Even I won't be able to stop them then.

163
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:50,330
How are we supposed to kill them all?

164
00:14:51,330 --> 00:14:52,200
Lu Yuanqing!

165
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:54,540
You've still got us!

166
00:15:17,790 --> 00:15:18,510
Mr. Lu!

167
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:20,660
This strike is for my son!

168
00:15:21,660 --> 00:15:24,880
Come on! I can still take you
with one hand!

169
00:15:24,930 --> 00:15:26,830
We've helped these monsters
commit evil for years.

170
00:15:27,410 --> 00:15:29,040
Today, we make amends.

171
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:29,910
Kill them!

172
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:46,580
What is this black mist?

173
00:15:46,950 --> 00:15:49,080
It's the corpse miasma of the Five Bugs.

174
00:15:49,580 --> 00:15:52,160
Once their bodies decay,

175
00:15:52,290 --> 00:15:56,160
their corpse miasma can linger
and feed on the mortal world.

176
00:15:57,450 --> 00:15:59,490
Senior, is there any other way?

177
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:01,790
The corpse miasma cannot be destroyed,

178
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:04,170
but it can be sealed away.

179
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:05,380
However,

180
00:16:05,430 --> 00:16:07,620
it requires a vessel.

181
00:16:07,790 --> 00:16:08,870
What kind of vessel?

182
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:11,410
Corpse miasma feeds on human life force,

183
00:16:11,500 --> 00:16:13,540
so it can also be sealed
within a human body.

184
00:16:13,750 --> 00:16:16,080
But once it enters the body,

185
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,870
it travels through the ghost meridian.

186
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:20,500
Ordinary people cannot
access the meridian.

187
00:16:20,660 --> 00:16:22,220
But the Seven Ghost-Head Nails

188
00:16:22,270 --> 00:16:24,410
opened yours.

189
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:28,120
The corpse miasma will erode
your spiritual consciousness

190
00:16:28,330 --> 00:16:30,830
and turn you into their puppet.

191
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,700
Are you willing to do it?

192
00:16:55,040 --> 00:16:55,790
(Young man,)

193
00:16:56,450 --> 00:16:58,200
(my battle is over.)

194
00:16:58,790 --> 00:16:59,790
(The left)

195
00:17:00,290 --> 00:17:01,500
(is for you.)

196
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:09,830
Senior.

197
00:17:10,870 --> 00:17:12,340
If I can't preserve

198
00:17:12,390 --> 00:17:14,200
the last shred of my spiritual
consciousness,

199
00:17:15,410 --> 00:17:16,540
then please

200
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:18,370
seal me

201
00:17:19,040 --> 00:17:20,870
in the Guixu Abyss.

202
00:17:22,790 --> 00:17:25,700
Have you thought this through?

203
00:17:26,080 --> 00:17:27,950
Rather than let it plague the world,

204
00:17:29,330 --> 00:17:30,620
I'd rather

205
00:17:31,660 --> 00:17:33,790
go to hell alone.

206
00:17:39,830 --> 00:17:40,830
What is he trying to do?

207
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:46,280
He wants to use his own body
as the vessel

208
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:47,630
and take us down with him!

209
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,420
Madman!

210
00:17:48,470 --> 00:17:50,370
He's insane!

211
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:08,290
Lu Yuanqing!

212
00:18:16,200 --> 00:18:17,040
Senior Turbid Dragon,

213
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,040
what happened to him?

214
00:18:18,540 --> 00:18:21,320
He's already lost his mind.

215
00:18:21,370 --> 00:18:23,910
I must seal him in the Guixu Abyss.

216
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,080
It's the only way.

217
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:32,830
Go.

218
00:18:33,290 --> 00:18:34,450
Find Xiaoyue.

219
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:36,120
Get her out of here!

220
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:48,620
The formation is almost complete.

221
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:50,830
All mortals, retreat at once!

222
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,160
Senior Turbid Dragon,

223
00:18:52,540 --> 00:18:54,410
Lu Yuanqing risked his life
to get this far.

224
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:56,250
All he wanted was
to take his sister home.

225
00:18:56,500 --> 00:18:59,290
Without him, we'd still be deceived
by those five filthy bugs.

226
00:18:59,370 --> 00:19:00,620
We can't do this to him.

227
00:19:01,040 --> 00:19:02,790
Please, give him a little more time.

228
00:19:03,040 --> 00:19:04,380
He can hold on to his spiritual
consciousness

229
00:19:04,430 --> 00:19:05,450
and come back to us.

230
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:07,610
The Five Bugs prey upon the mind.

231
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:10,380
No ordinary strength can resist them.

232
00:19:10,430 --> 00:19:12,830
Exactly. If he loses himself
to the miasma,

233
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:14,910
who knows how many people he'll kill?

234
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:17,290
He may be a hero,

235
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:20,080
but he chose to sacrifice himself.

236
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:22,290
Shouldn't we honor his choice?

237
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:23,790
He saved you!

238
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:25,410
How can you do this to him?

239
00:19:25,540 --> 00:19:29,290
If the corpse miasma completely
takes over his spiritual consciousness,

240
00:19:29,540 --> 00:19:31,660
he'll become just like the Five Bugs

241
00:19:31,830 --> 00:19:33,200
and bring ruin upon the world.

242
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:37,870
Are you all willing to take that risk?

243
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:43,200
I, Yan Jiu of the Redtail Armed Escort
Agency,

244
00:19:43,290 --> 00:19:44,580
vouch for him with my life.

245
00:19:44,660 --> 00:19:46,410
If Lu Yuanqing completely loses control,

246
00:19:46,540 --> 00:19:47,910
I swear I won't let him escape.

247
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,300
- Even if it means
- Even if it means

248
00:19:49,350 --> 00:19:50,660
- entering the Guixu Abyss with him!
- entering the Guixu Abyss with him!

249
00:19:59,450 --> 00:20:01,080
Kill them!

250
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,580
Kill!

251
00:20:03,200 --> 00:20:05,540
Let's all go to hell together!

252
00:20:16,450 --> 00:20:17,250
Yuanqing!

253
00:20:26,660 --> 00:20:28,760
Yuanqing, you're hurt!

254
00:20:28,810 --> 00:20:29,830
Are you okay?

255
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:35,000
He's responding!

256
00:20:35,290 --> 00:20:36,160
Senior Turbid Dragon!

257
00:20:36,450 --> 00:20:37,550
He's still conscious.

258
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:39,330
There's not much time left.

259
00:20:39,450 --> 00:20:41,750
Make your choice, quickly.

260
00:20:41,950 --> 00:20:43,080
Let's put it to a count.

261
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:45,260
Anyone who thinks he should
be sealed in the Guixu Abyss,

262
00:20:45,310 --> 00:20:46,040
step forward.

263
00:20:50,370 --> 00:20:51,700
I, Zhu Si of the Medicine Lodge,

264
00:20:51,870 --> 00:20:54,410
vouch for Mr. Lu with my life.

265
00:20:55,290 --> 00:20:56,830
I, Zhang Xiaohua of Caomiao Village,

266
00:20:57,370 --> 00:20:58,830
believe in Mr. Lu.

267
00:21:00,370 --> 00:21:01,760
I, Zhang Ergou of Huangshu Village,

268
00:21:01,810 --> 00:21:03,120
believe in Mr. Lu.

269
00:21:03,200 --> 00:21:05,920
I, Zhao Hengzhu of Tiejiang Village,
stake my life on Mr. Lu.

270
00:21:05,970 --> 00:21:09,200
I, Zhang Daniu, stake my life
on him too.

271
00:21:11,660 --> 00:21:12,410
Brother...

272
00:21:33,370 --> 00:21:37,160
Lu Yuanqing, you can't escape us.

273
00:21:59,830 --> 00:22:00,750
(My blade...)

274
00:22:01,290 --> 00:22:02,370
(I still have my blade.)

275
00:22:58,410 --> 00:22:59,200
Yuanqing!

276
00:23:00,250 --> 00:23:04,000
(He's awake! Mr. Lu is all right!)

277
00:23:04,660 --> 00:23:05,450
